# Raw Input and HIDAPI (SPK-01, hardware-matrix): Pad A holds east and
# south when it is unplugged. SDL sends their ups, then removed. The pad
# comes back with a new id while both are still held, and SDL reports a
# down of each 65 ms after added (HIDAPI; about 2 ms on Raw Input). They
# are presses like any other: the first confirms the slot, east holds Space
# again and south taps Ctrl+Z a second time.
